message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: Trader's Edge
abstract: >-
  An open-source serious game that teaches beginners financial and trading
  decision-making. Short lessons and quick checks lead into missions in a
  seeded simulated market of fictional companies against rule-based rivals,
  with order types unlocked as the curriculum teaches them.
